  "description": "“Just give me a chance to love you.” Seo Yoon, a successful project planner, has a problem: the new employee Seo Dohyeon keeps invading her private space. He’s a man who doesn’t believe in love—yet he keeps talking to her about it. Afraid of the way he rushes in like a tidal wave, Seo Yoon decides it’s better to give him just one night and end things… “But what can I do? If you offer it, I’ll gladly take it.”\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=843115), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13119104)\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Indonesian](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romance/at-our-own-pace/list?title_no=9378), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/at-our-own-pace/list?title_no=9445), [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/at-our-own-pace/list?title_no=9304)",
